WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
Skip counting, even and odd

2
00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:10.167
Mama sets out oranges in pairs. Let us count in twos.

3
00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:13.800
Two, four, six, eight, ten: we counted in twos.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.433
Every orange has a partner, so ten is an even number.

5
00:00:17.433 --> 00:00:21.067
If we add one more orange, one is left on its own: eleven is an odd number.

6
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:25.000
Counting in fives is fast too: five, ten, fifteen, twenty.
